"The platform's own trust. Nothing is changed." = "使用平台自身的信任，不做任何改變。";
"The port is a number from 1 to 65535." = "連接埠要在 1 到 65535 之間。";
"The previous LAN proxy credentials could not be restored securely. Reset them before trying again." = "先前的區域網路代理認證資訊無法安全回復。請重置後重試。";
"The previous script carry-over left an unknown state." = "上次搬動舊版指令碼留下了未知狀態。";
"The previous script upgrade state is invalid. Restore a backup before changing profiles." = "先前的指令碼升級狀態無效。更改設定檔前請先回復備份。";
"The profile %@ already has a post-processing script, so the previous version's script was not carried over." = "設定檔 %@ 已有一個後處理指令碼，舊版的全域指令碼沒有搬過來。";
"The profile %@ could not be prepared with its settings." = "設定檔 %@ 帶著它的設定無法準備就緒。";
"The profile %@ could not be prepared with the previous version's script." = "設定檔 %@ 帶著舊版指令碼無法準備就緒。";
"The profile %@ has no local copy, so its settings could not be checked." = "設定檔 %@ 沒有本機副本，無法核對它的設定。";
"The profile URL conflicts with your rule edits. Your current profile was kept." = "連結更新與規則修改衝突，已保留目前設定檔。";
"The profile URL did not provide a profile." = "設定檔連結未提供源設定檔。";
"The profile URL no longer has the node %@; the dialer you set on it was dropped." = "設定檔連結裡已沒有節點 %@，你給它設的 dialer 已丟棄。";
"The profile URL no longer has this source; your edit of it was dropped." = "設定檔連結裡已沒有這個來源，你對它的修改已丟棄。";
"The profile URL now has a source with this name too; your keys were merged over it." = "設定檔連結裡也有了同名來源，已把你的鍵合併進去。";
"The profile URL response is not UTF-8 YAML." = "設定檔連結回應不是 UTF-8 設定檔文字。";
"The profile URL returned no YAML." = "設定檔網址沒有回傳設定檔。";
"The profile URL was not modified, but this profile has no active revision." = "設定檔連結沒有新內容，但這份設定檔還沒有可用的版本";
"The profile URL's own values come back; the edit is discarded." = "恢復為設定檔連結裡的值，本機修改作廢。";
"The profile cannot be empty." = "設定檔內容不能為空。";
"The profile could not be imported." = "設定檔無法匯入。";
"The profile could not be saved." = "設定檔無法儲存。";
"The profile is no longer available." = "這個設定檔已不存在。";
"The profile library changed. Reopen it and try again." = "設定檔庫已變更，請重新開啟再試。";
"The profile library contains an invalid identifier." = "設定檔庫裡有無效的識別碼。";
"The profile library could not be read. Its contents were left unchanged." = "設定檔庫讀取失敗，內容未變更。";
"The profile library is busy. Try again." = "設定檔庫忙碌中，請再試一次。";
"The profile list could not be read, so it was left untouched. Restore from a backup, or remove the app's data to start over." = "設定檔列表無法讀取，已原樣保留未做改動。請從備份回復，或刪除 App 資料重新開始。";
"The profile was not deleted." = "設定檔沒有刪除。";
"The profile's own rules remain in effect. Add only the exception you need." = "設定檔自帶的規則仍然生效。只新增你需要的例外。";
"The profile's saved selection could not be cleared." = "無法清除設定檔裡儲存的選擇。";
"The provider could not be downloaded, decrypted, or validated. The published revision was kept." = "外部資源沒能下載、解密或驗證，繼續使用現有內容";
"The provider definition is not a valid object." = "集合定義不是有效物件。";
"The provider name is invalid." = "集合名稱無效。";
"The proxy credential configuration is invalid." = "代理認證資訊設定檔無效。";
"The query did not complete." = "查詢沒有完成。";
"The raw patch must be a JSON object. The previous configuration remains unchanged." = "原始補丁必須是 JSON 物件。先前的設定檔保持不變。";
"The relay repeats a member, so its hop order is ambiguous." = "中繼重複引用了同一成員，跳數順序無法確定。";
"The reply carried no address." = "回應未攜帶網址。";
"The reply carried no address. Names cannot be resolved with these settings on this network." = "回應中不含網址。在目前網路下，用這些設定無法解析網域。";
"The resource exceeded Clash’s safety limit and was not saved." = "該資源超出 Clash 的安全上限，未儲存。";
"The resource was validated and saved atomically." = "資源已驗證並原子儲存。";
"The response was not a usable configuration resource." = "回應不是可用的設定檔資源。";
"The rewrites, scripts and some rules of “%@” are more than memory can hold, so they weren't loaded." = "「%@」的重寫、指令碼和部分規則太多，記憶體裝不下，沒有載入。";
"The rule is empty." = "規則為空。";
"The rule provider references a member of the rule bundle archive. Clash must materialize the matching bundle before activation." = "這個規則集用到了規則包裡的檔案，目前還不能使用";
"The rules are at a link. Use Update Source to download and view them." = "規則內容儲存在連結中，點一下「更新來源」下載並檢視。";
"The running proxy group did not confirm the selected route." = "這次選擇沒有生效，請再試一次";
"The running tunnel did not accept the mode change. The profile was saved; the mode applies on the next connect." = "執行中的通道沒有接受模式切換。設定檔已儲存，下次連線時生效。";
"The running tunnel did not take the change, so nothing was changed." = "沒有切換成功，仍使用原來的模式";
"The saved IP Stack settings are invalid or require a newer app version. They have not been changed." = "已儲存的 IP Stack 設定無效或需要更高版本的App，原設定未被修改。";
"The saved configuration is damaged. Import it again." = "儲存的設定檔已損壞，請重新匯入。";
"The saved configuration is unavailable." = "無法讀取已儲存的設定檔。";
"The saved profile URL carries sign-in details or query values. Removing them keeps the scheme, host and path only, and may require re-importing if the provider needs them." = "儲存的連結攜帶登入資訊或查詢參數。移除後只保留 scheme、主機與路徑；若提供方需要這些參數，可能需要重新匯入。";
"The saved runtime has no matching source profile." = "找不到對應的設定檔，請重新選擇一份設定檔";
"The script carry-over could not be saved; the previous settings are back in place." = "舊版指令碼沒能搬過來；已恢復上次的設定。";
"The script carry-over was interrupted and could not be undone automatically. Restore a backup before changing profiles." = "搬動舊版指令碼被打斷，且未能自動還原。修改設定檔前請先回復備份。";
"The script couldn’t run." = "指令碼沒能執行";
"The script didn't finish in %@ seconds." = "指令碼沒有在 %@ 秒內完成。";
"The script didn't run." = "指令碼沒有執行。";
"The script didn’t return the configuration." = "指令碼沒有回傳設定檔";
"The script failed: %@" = "指令碼出錯：%@";
"The script has no main function." = "指令碼裡沒有 main 函式";
"The script ran and returned nothing." = "指令碼已執行，沒有傳回內容。";
"The script ran too long and was stopped." = "指令碼執行太久，已停止";
"The script ran too long and was stopped. A loop that never ends will do this." = "指令碼執行時間過長已被停止。寫出永不結束的迴圈會導致這種情況。";
"The script stopped with an error." = "指令碼執行出錯，已停止。";
"The script upgrade could not be saved. Your previous settings were restored." = "指令碼升級無法儲存。已回復你先前的設定。";
"The script upgrade was interrupted and automatic recovery could not be confirmed. Restore a backup before changing profiles." = "指令碼升級被中斷，無法確定是否已自動回復。更改設定檔前請先回復備份";
"The selected diagnostics report is no longer valid." = "所選的診斷報告已失效。";
"The selected exit is no longer available." = "所選出口已不可用。";
"The selected image could not be read." = "無法讀取所選圖片。";
"The selected rule-set format is not valid for this behavior." = "所選 rule-set 格式對該 behavior 無效。";
"The selected script is no longer available. Choose another script and try again." = "所選指令碼已不可用。請選擇其他指令碼後重試。";
"The server answered with a page, not a script." = "這個指令碼用不了，已跳過。";
"The server could not be reached after retrying. Check connectivity and try again." = "重試後仍無法連線伺服器。請檢查網路後再試。";
"The server name could not be resolved. Check the network, then try again." = "無法解析伺服器名稱。請檢查網路後再試。";
"The server refused this link (HTTP %@). Check the user name and password in the link. The link may also have expired or been reset, or the provider may limit which apps can use it." = "伺服器拒絕了此連結（HTTP %@）。請檢查連結中的使用者名稱和密碼；也可能是連結已過期或已被重設，或提供方限制了可使用的用戶端。";
"The server refused this link (HTTP %@). The link may have expired or been reset, or the provider may limit which apps can use it." = "伺服器拒絕了此連結（HTTP %@）。可能是連結已過期或已被重設，也可能是提供方限制了可使用的用戶端。";
"The server rejected the saved credentials. Update them before retrying." = "伺服器拒絕了已儲存的認證資訊。請更新後再試。";
"The server returned HTTP %@" = "伺服器回傳 HTTP %@";
"The server returned HTTP %@. Try again or check the profile source." = "伺服器回傳 HTTP %@。請重試或檢查設定檔來源。";
"The server returned an invalid response." = "伺服器回傳了無效回應。";
"The server sent an empty file instead of a script." = "這個指令碼用不了，已跳過。";
"The server's certificate isn't trusted on this device, or the server asked for a client certificate." = "這台裝置不信任伺服器的憑證，或伺服器要求用戶端憑證。";
"The settings carry-over could not be saved; the previous settings are back in place." = "舊版設定沒能搬過來；已恢復上次的設定。";
"The settings carry-over stopped partway; the profile %@ is still on the previous layout." = "舊版設定只搬了一半；設定檔 %@ 還在舊版佈局上。";
"The settings carry-over was interrupted and could not be undone automatically. Restore a backup before changing profiles." = "搬動舊版設定被打斷，且未能自動還原。修改設定檔前請先回復備份。";
"The settings upgrade could not be saved. Your previous settings were restored." = "設定升級無法儲存。已回復你先前的設定。";
"The settings upgrade was interrupted and automatic recovery could not be confirmed. Do not change profiles until you restore a backup." = "設定升級被中斷，無法確定是否已自動回復。回復備份前請不要更改設定檔";
"The share link could not be read." = "這條分享連結讀不出來。";
"The shared JSON is what this inbox holds: the system's payload complete and unfiltered, under a small Clash header. Nothing is taken out of it, so it can name your servers and addresses. Clash has no automatic diagnostics uploader." = "分享出去的 JSON 就是這裡儲存的那一份：系統的載荷完整、不做任何過濾，外面套一層 Clash 的小信封。裡面什麼都沒被拿掉，所以它可能寫出你的伺服器與網址。Clash 沒有任何自動上傳診斷資料的機制。";
"The shared configuration is empty." = "共享的設定檔為空。";
"The shared container is unavailable." = "共享容器不可用。";
"The source belongs to this profile; its live health remains read-only in Utilities." = "該來源屬於本設定檔；其即時健康狀態在「工具」中保持唯讀。";
"The source changed while it was downloaded; the newer one is kept." = "下載期間原始碼有了更改，已保留較新的那份。";
"The source could not be opened." = "打不開原始碼。";
"The source is downloaded before it is saved." = "儲存前會先下載來源。";
"The source is downloaded on first Sync or activation." = "源會在首次同步或啟用時下載。";
"The stored source and effective comparison does not contain a known iOS rewrite." = "源文字與生效設定檔的對比中沒有已知的 iOS 改寫。";
"The stored source and effective comparison does not contain a known macOS rewrite." = "源文字與生效設定檔的對比中沒有已知的 macOS 改寫。";
"The system VPN service isn’t responding. Please try again in a moment, or restart your Mac." = "系統 VPN 服務無回應。請稍後重試，或重新啟動 Mac。";
"The system VPN service isn’t responding. Please try again in a moment, or restart your device." = "系統 VPN 服務無回應。請稍後重試，或重新啟動裝置。";
"The system action could not be completed." = "系統操作未能完成。";
"The system decides when Wi-Fi and cellular are used together, so this line was skipped." = "Wi-Fi 和行動網路何時一起用由系統決定，這一行已跳過。";
"The system does not grant that right." = "系統不授予該許可權。";
"The system prepares these reports on device. Clash keeps a copy locally — the payload complete and unfiltered, under a small header of its own — and never uploads it automatically. A report past the size or nesting cap is stored as a note saying so." = "這些報告由系統在裝置上生成。Clash 只在本機保留一份——載荷完整、不做任何過濾，外面套一層它自己的小信封——絕不自動上傳。超過體積或巢狀上限的報告，存成一條說明。";
"The system stopped the tunnel while it was loading %@. It was using %@ at the time." = "載入 %@ 時被系統停止，當時佔用 %@";
"The system stopped the tunnel while it was starting. It was using %@ at the time." = "連線過程中被系統停止，當時佔用 %@";
"The system uses the first matching rule. Drag to reorder. A Disconnect rule with SSIDs is an exclusion; a Connect rule with SSIDs is an inclusion." = "系統採用第一條符合的規則。拖移可排序。帶 SSID 的「中斷」規則是排除，帶 SSID 的「連線」規則是包含。";
"The time check interval must be a positive number of minutes, or empty to use the profile default." = "時間驗證間隔須為正數分鐘，留空則使用設定檔預設值。";
"The time server port must be between 1 and 65535, or empty to use the profile default." = "時間伺服器連接埠須在 1 到 65535 之間，留空則使用設定檔預設值。";
"The time service route must be a short, printable policy group or node name." = "時間服務線路必須是簡短可列印的策略群組或節點名。";
"The tun interface the tunnel is built on." = "通道所基於的 tun 介面。";
"The tunnel did not confirm this update." = "這次更新尚未生效";
"The tunnel did not finish stopping." = "中斷連線沒有完成，請再試一次";
"The tunnel runs the sing-box (Go) packet stack, whatever stack a profile writes: on iPhone and iPad the tunnel reads its own network interface, and that stack is the one built to drive it." = "通道一律執行 sing-box 協定堆疊（Go），不管設定檔寫的是哪個堆疊：iPhone 和 iPad 上通道直接讀寫自己的虛擬網卡，這個堆疊就是為此而做的。";
"The tunnel runs the sing-box (Go) packet stack, whatever stack a profile writes: on the Mac the tunnel reads its own network interface, and that stack is the one built to drive it." = "通道一律執行 sing-box 協定堆疊（Go），不管設定檔寫的是哪個堆疊：Mac 上通道直接讀寫自己的虛擬網卡，這個堆疊就是為此而做的。";
"The tunnel stays connected. The new language takes effect when Clash reopens." = "連線不受影響。新語言在重新開啟 Clash 後生效";
"The tunnel stopped without a request from Clash." = "連線已中斷連線，開啟 Clash 可重新連線";
"The tunnel’s start failed: %@. It was using %@ at the time." = "連線時出錯：%@。當時佔用 %@";
"The two ports must differ." = "兩個連接埠不能相同。";
"The universal proxy platform" = "通用代理平台";
"The update interval must be zero or a positive number of seconds." = "更新間隔須為零或正數秒。";
"The upgraded script would change a profile's runtime behavior, so nothing was changed." = "升級後的指令碼會改變某份設定檔的實際效果，因此沒有做任何更改";
"The upgraded settings would change a profile's runtime behavior, so nothing was changed." = "升級後的設定會改變某份設定檔的實際效果，因此沒有做任何更改";
"The upstream proxy kernel Clash is built on. Every rule, protocol and DNS decision is its work." = "Clash 所基於的上游代理核心。每一條規則、每一種協定、每一次 DNS 決策都出自它。";
"The userspace TCP/IP stack every connection is carried by." = "承載每一條連線的使用者態 TCP/IP 協定堆疊。";
"The validated source was saved." = "已儲存驗證透過的來源。";
"Their nodes join the group." = "這些集合裡的節點會加入這個組。";
"Theme" = "主題";
"Theme Mode" = "主題模式";
"There isn't enough memory to run this script right now. Try again later." = "現在記憶體不夠，這個指令碼沒有執行，稍後再試。";
"These DNS settings belong only to this configuration." = "僅用於此設定檔，連結更新會保留這些設定。";
"These DNS settings have changes that have not been saved." = "這些 DNS 設定有尚未儲存的更改。";
"These exceptions belong to this profile. Its imported source stays unchanged." = "這些例外屬於本設定檔，匯入的原始碼不受影響。";
"These fields are removed:" = "這些欄位會被移除：";
"These fields change how the current profile routes traffic." = "這些欄位會改變目前設定檔轉發流量的方式。";
"These nodes are a source of their own. A configuration uses them once it turns this source on in its Proxies chapter." = "這裡的節點是一個獨立的「節點來源」。某份設定檔要在它的「出站代理」裡開啟這一項，才會用到它們。";
"These nodes are a source of their own. A configuration uses them once it turns this source on, under Node Sources." = "這裡的節點是一個獨立的「節點來源」。某份設定檔要在它的「節點來源」裡開啟這一項，才會用到它們。";
"These nodes have changes that have not been saved." = "這些節點有尚未儲存的改動。";
"These overrides apply to the generated runtime only. The imported profile remains unchanged." = "這些改動只作用於生效中的設定檔，匯入的設定檔保持不變";
"These proxy sources and rule sets belong to this profile and update without changing the original file." = "這些代理來源與規則集屬於本設定檔，更新時不會改動原檔案。";
"These proxy sources supply nodes to this profile without changing its imported source." = "這些代理來源為此設定檔提供節點，不會改動匯入的源文字。";
"These rule sets supply matching data to this profile without changing its imported source." = "這些規則集為此設定檔提供符合資料，不會改動匯入的源文字。";
"These rules are added after the configuration's own rules when it is used." = "使用此設定檔時，這些規則會加在它自己的規則之後。";
"These rules are added in front of the configuration's own rules when it is used." = "使用此設定檔時，這些規則會加在它自己的規則之前。";
"These rules are too many to edit one by one here. They run as written in the configuration's file." = "規則太多，無法在這裡逐條編輯；它們按設定檔裡寫的原樣執行。";
"These rules could not be read. Try again." = "這些規則讀取失敗，請重試。";
"These rules send traffic there." = "這些規則把流量送往那裡。";
"These rules work only in their original configuration and can't be saved as a rule scheme." = "這些規則只能在原始設定檔中使用，無法存成規則方案。";
"These rules work only in their original configuration, so choose Original or another scheme under Rule Scheme." = "這些規則只能在原始設定檔中使用，請在「規則方案」裡選擇「原始設定檔」或其他方案。";
"These scripts were imported before the app kept their link, so there is nothing to fetch yet. Import each from its link once more; Update works from then on." = "這些指令碼是在 App 還沒記錄來源連結的版本裡匯入的，暫時無從拉取。用連結重新匯入一次，之後就能更新。";
"These scripts will be deleted. Profiles using them must choose another script before starting." = "這些指令碼將被刪除。使用它們的設定檔需要先選擇其他指令碼，才能啟動。";
"These settings also affect the final configuration. Existing overrides and scripts are preserved." = "這些設定也會影響最終設定檔。既有覆寫與指令稿會繼續保留。";
"These settings apply to every profile." = "這一頁的設定對所有設定檔生效。";
"These settings apply to every profile. Imported sources stay unchanged." = "這些設定對所有設定檔生效，匯入的原始碼不受影響。";
"These settings now apply to every profile. %@ values set on other profiles were replaced by the profile that was active." = "這些設定現在對所有設定檔生效。你在其他設定檔上設過的 %@ 項已被當時正在使用的設定檔的值取代。";
"These settings return to yours when this module is off." = "關掉這個模組，這些設定就恢復成你自己的。";
"These ship with the operating system rather than with this app, and are named here to describe what it is built against." = "這些隨作業系統提供，不隨本 App 分發；列在這裡，是為了說明本 App 基於什麼建置。";
"These sub-rules can only be changed in the source." = "這些子規則只能在原始碼中修改。";
"This Configuration" = "本設定檔";
"This Device" = "本機";
"This Device (127.0.0.1)" = "僅本機（127.0.0.1）";
"This Device Only · %@" = "僅本機 · %@";
"This Device · %@" = "僅本機 · %@";
"This Profile's Exceptions" = "此設定檔的例外規則";
"This action is not available on this device." = "此操作在本裝置上不可用。";
"This action is not supported on this platform." = "此平台不支援該操作。";
"This action needs system permission." = "此操作需要系統授權。";
"This address cannot be parsed as a resolver." = "該網址無法解析為解析器。";
