"This app added %@ after what you wrote; yours are all still there." = "在你寫的內容之後加了 %@；你寫的都還在";
"This app added %@ to the end of what you wrote; everything you wrote is still there." = "在你寫的內容末尾加了 %@；你寫的每一條都還在";
"This app applies this before the core starts, so what you wrote takes effect." = "你寫的會生效";
"This app calls none of these directly. All of them are compiled into the binary it ships." = "本 App 不直接呼叫這些元件，但它們都編譯進了 App 本身。";
