"This configuration was exported from Clash, so only the rules in your modules work; import the original configuration to use rewrites and scripts too." = "目前設定檔是從 Clash 匯出的，只有模組裡的規則生效；匯入原本的設定檔，重寫和指令碼也能生效。";
"This configuration’s file is not YAML the editor can change. Edit it in the source." = "這份設定檔的檔案不是編輯器能改的 YAML，請在原始碼裡改。";
"This core does not recognise that record type." = "不支援這種記錄類型";
"This device" = "本機";
"This device can't see the other devices on your network, so this rule was skipped." = "這台裝置看不到區域網路中的其他裝置，已跳過。";
"This device can't tell which app a connection comes from, so this rule was skipped." = "這台裝置無法分辨連線來自哪個 App，已跳過。";
