"This expression uses nesting the condition builder does not cover; edit it verbatim." = "此表示式使用了條件建構子未覆寫的巢狀，請按原文編輯。";
"This file carries your credentials so a restore works straight away. Treat it as private." = "該檔案包含你的認證資訊，回復後可直接使用。請按私人資料對待。";
"This file holds more than one YAML document. Edit it in the source." = "這份檔案裡有多個 YAML 文件，請在原始碼裡改。";
